{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"body":"Plan evidence (verified 2026-10-30): git-remote-s3 0.4.2 cmd_push rejects a non-forced push whose remote tip is not an ancestor, then takes a per-ref S3 conditional-write lock and re-lists the ref, rejecting 'stale remote' on change; S3 losers also see PreconditionFailed, ConditionalRequestConflict or a 404 HeadObject, so outcome is decided by re-reading the tip, not by text. _read_blob_bytes already reads commit-shaped refs. rebar 0.13.x: _mode_blocks treats an unrecognised mode as no gate; _decode_pause returns None when 'paused' is absent; _decode_blob ignores extra fields; steal_pass_lock steals after one lease when (oid, fence) is unchanged."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1793387878985781001,"uuid":"29d8c279-3605-45a6-85d2-9726f5e2cc8b"}